{
  "tema": 6227,
  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-o-ue-er",
  "titulo": "Conjugate stem-changing -er verbs (o > ue) in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Vuelva, mueva, volvamos: ue everywhere except nosotros.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "-er verbs with o > ue in the present keep it in the subjunctive, except nosotros: vuelva, vuelvas, volvamos, vuelvan.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**-er** verbs that change **o > ue** in the present have the same change in the present subjunctive: **ue** in every form **except nosotros**. The endings are the regular **-er** subjunctive ones."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "volver",
            "mover"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "vuelva",
              "mueva"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "vuelvas",
              "muevas"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "vuelva",
              "mueva"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "volvamos",
              "movamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "vuelvan",
              "muevan"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Other verbs like this: **poder**, **devolver**, **promover**, **disolver**, **envolver**, **demoler**, **resolver**, **cocer**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Careful: some also change a consonant to keep the sound. **Cocer** → **cueza** (the **c** becomes **z** before **a**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: same boot as the **-ar** verbs. **Nosotros** stays outside with the plain **o**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Dudo que ==vuelva== antes de las cinco.",
              "en": "I doubt I'll be back before five."
            },
