              "en": "Don't go back to him; he's a liar."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Movamos== estas cajas para allá.",
              "en": "Let's move these boxes over there."
            },
            {
              "es": "Por favor, no ==muevan== esos papeles.",
              "en": "Please don't move those papers."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Quieres que ==cueza== la pasta?",
              "en": "Do you want me to boil the pasta?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Está bien que ==promuevan== sus descuentos.",
              "en": "It's good that they promote their discounts."
            },
            {
              "es": "Espero que me ==devuelvas== la tabla mañana.",
              "en": "I hope you give me back the board tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        }
